/T (Eddy has been the portrait of a good son until now. Having left England with his mother, he now holds claims both on Normandy and the English crown. Many in England still remember his charming personality and his courage. Charm is still not enough to win a crown, though- where good looks fail, one needs supplies, strategy, and bravery.)
/E (Eddy has been the portrait of a good son until now. Having left England with his mother, he now holds claims both on Normandy and the English crown. Many in England still remember his charming personality and his courage. Charm is still not enough to win a crown, though- where good looks fail, one needs supplies, strategy, and bravery.)
