/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 91 0 R
/T ( Having left France for 15 years, not too much has changed within court life. In his absence, Charles VIII has reigned France with a fair and just rule. Yet, the Burgundian French-Burgundian Union power has shifted towards the Burgundian nobles. With the return of Louis XI, Charles VIII regency comes to a close as many wonder how Louis XI will restore French power. Louis also comes back to a welcome surprise- a heir for the crown! )
/E ( Having left France for 15 years, not too much has changed within court life. In his absence, Charles VIII has reigned France with a fair and just rule. Yet, the Burgundian French-Burgundian Union power has shifted towards the Burgundian nobles. With the return of Louis XI, Charles VIII regency comes to a close as many wonder how Louis XI will restore French power. Louis also comes back to a welcome surprise- a heir for the crown! )
