214 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 91 0 R
/T ( Shortly before the big plunge underwater, Charles was the victim of a poisoning. Time runs slowly in Atlantis, however, and he was very ill for seven long years. Yet, he has risen out of the depths to find that his line has blossomed in the new world order. The Burgundian royal court was more than happy to accept Charles the Bold back. The dominant partner in the Franco-Burgundian union is Burgundy, yet the French nobles still hold major sway. To ensure a secure realm, the goals of Burgundy must be met while the French nobles placated. )
/E ( Shortly before the big plunge underwater, Charles was the victim of a poisoning. Time runs slowly in Atlantis, however, and he was very ill for seven long years. Yet, he has risen out of the depths to find that his line has blossomed in the new world order. The Burgundian royal court was more than happy to accept Charles the Bold back. The dominant partner in the Franco-Burgundian union is Burgundy, yet the French nobles still hold major sway. To ensure a secure realm, the goals of Burgundy must be met while the French nobles placated. )
