715 0 obj
<<
/Title (While Henry was waiting to get his throne back, a new threat had come for him in the name of Perkin Warbeck. His wife has now divorced him and he has no money left in his pockets, though he now has a great power in Parliament with his fellow fallen Lancastrians. After being kicked out of England royalty, he was welcomed in the Welsh noble class. He is also considered the French heir to the throne and is now thinking about taking back his throne in France.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 692 0 R
/Next 727 0 R
